WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.633
- Hark, there she be.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:07.052
(dramatic threatening music plays)

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:13.793
- Follow me.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.113
Your griffin queen.

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.700
Away from this fortress

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.990
and back to the kingdom of Eldervale.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.293
- But what about the king?

00:00:23.657 --> 00:00:26.800
(loud growls and scrapes)

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.040
- The king is dead.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.690
- I case you haven't noticed, I'm weird.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.120
I'm a weirdo.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.710
I don't fit in.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:37.503
I don't wanna fit in.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.400
Have you ever seen me
without this stupid hat on?

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.233
That's weird.

00:00:42.727 --> 00:00:44.977
(chanting)

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.850
(alarm beeps)

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.517
(babies gurgle)

00:00:55.464 --> 00:00:58.381
(high chord plays)

00:01:01.908 --> 00:01:05.092
(dog growls)

00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:08.433
(loud whooshing)

00:01:08.433 --> 00:01:10.933
(chord plays)

00:01:12.563 --> 00:01:16.313
(growling and loud punching)

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.840
- This is a message for the coward

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.403
calling himself the Black Hood.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.080
You think you can attack
us from the shadows,

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:31.790
but Riverdale is a lot stronger than you.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:32.840
And we're not afraid.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:36.780
You see, there's only one of you,

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.103
but we are legion.

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:41.310
We're called the Red Circle.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.070
And we're coming for you.

00:01:45.288 --> 00:01:48.576
(dramatic music plays)

00:01:48.576 --> 00:01:52.904
(whoosh and arrow vibrates)

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:56.340
- I suggest you run whilst you still can.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.913
I only miss when I mean to.

00:01:59.984 --> 00:02:04.362
(dramatic music plays loudly)

00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:06.416
(arrow whooshes)

00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:10.679
♪ Children waiting for
the day, they feel good ♪

00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:15.679
♪ Happy birthday, happy birthday ♪

00:02:16.867 --> 00:02:21.797
♪ And I feel the way
that every child should ♪

00:02:21.797 --> 00:02:25.880
♪ Sit and listen, sit and listen ♪

00:02:29.781 --> 00:02:32.614
(Mad World plays)

00:02:39.471 --> 00:02:42.562
♪ And I find it kinda funny, ♪

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.498
♪ I find it kinda sad ♪

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.760
♪ The dreams in which I'm dying ♪

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.002
♪ Are the best I've ever had ♪

00:02:51.002 --> 00:02:53.770
♪ I find it hard to tell you, ♪

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.672
♪ I find it hard to take ♪

00:02:56.672 --> 00:03:01.672
♪ When people run in
circles it's a very very ♪

00:03:02.238 --> 00:03:04.571
♪ Mad world ♪

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.230
- If we weren't here we'd be
in high school, joining clubs

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.430
trying out for sports.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.680
- Not me.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.350
I dropped out in the fourth grade,

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.313
to run drugs, to support my nanna.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.334
- That means you haven't know
the triumphs and defeats,

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.480
the epic highs and lows
of high school football.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.313
But you will.

00:03:26.785 --> 00:03:29.702
(rock music plays)

00:03:32.972 --> 00:03:35.540
♪ The warden threw a party
at the county jail. ♪

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.431
♪ The prison band was there
and they began to wail. ♪

00:03:38.431 --> 00:03:41.232
♪ The bank was jumpin' and
the joint began to swing. ♪

00:03:41.232 --> 00:03:43.740
♪ You should've heard those
knocked out jailbirds sing. ♪

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.261
♪ Let's rock ♪

00:03:46.261 --> 00:03:49.646
♪ Everybody, let's rock. ♪

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:52.402
♪ Everybody in the whole cell block ♪

00:03:52.402 --> 00:03:56.149
♪ Was dancin' to the jailhouse rock. ♪

00:03:56.149 --> 00:03:59.066
(mournful singing)

00:04:08.188 --> 00:04:10.188
(sighs)

00:04:12.763 --> 00:04:15.846
(gentle music plays)

00:04:16.727 --> 00:04:18.380
- Hello Archie

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.060
My name is Monica Posh.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.610
I'm with Riverdale's chapter
of the innocence project,

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.973
and I'll be working to help
get you out of this place.

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:31.350
(piano plays softly)

00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:44.041
(sexy pop music plays)

00:05:00.895 --> 00:05:03.900
- So, to settle this
matter once and for all,

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.733
maestro?

00:05:04.733 --> 00:05:05.755
- Okay, ah sure--

00:05:05.755 --> 00:05:09.283
♪ That's not my name ♪
Ah, Cheryl.

00:05:11.656 --> 00:05:14.913
♪I hear that word, sounding so sweet, ♪

00:05:14.913 --> 00:05:18.367
♪ Thousands of voices forever repeating. ♪

00:05:18.367 --> 00:05:21.784
♪ Carrie Carrie, Carrie. ♪

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:28.374
(upbeat dance music plays)

